**LOGGING STRATEGY:**

- Log invitation token presence/absence at OAuth initiation
- Log validation success/failure in callback handler
- Log database trigger matching logic (token vs email)
- Log profile creation and invitation acceptance status
- Use consistent log format: `[OAuth Invitation] action: details`
